error BYN2802: `Door.close` is `void close(ref this)` but `IDoor` requires `void close(ref this)`

  11 │     void close(ref this is .ajar) becomes .shut {
     │          ^^^^^ requires a receiver state
     │                             ---- `IDoor.close` cannot require a state
     │
  help: remove the receiver state on `Door.close`
